      "arabic": "١١٤١٥- صفية بنت عطية\nروى عنها غياث بن عبد العزيز، وهي جدّته، حديثها عند أبي داود، من رواية أبي بحر البكراوي، عنه، عنها: دخلت مع نسوة من عبد القيس على عائشة، فسألناها عن التمر والزبيب ... الحديث.",
      "english": "11415—Safiyya bint 'Atiyya\n\nGhiyath ibn 'Abd al-'Aziz narrated from her; she was his grandmother. Her hadith is recorded by Abu Dawud through the narration of Abu Bahr al-Bakrawi, from him, from her: “I entered the presence of Aisha with a group of women from 'Abd al-Qays, and we asked her about dates and raisins…”—the hadith.",
      "arabic_sha256": "be60c982410afa9658ef1991876193fda71e3b3c804a4e05cb34df563a6b54e9",
      "english_sha256": "bdae58fdc65b7e9e5a3a60a991e84a765c7b38740d152cbc7848efa56578c34e",
      "machine_state": "machine_validated_unreviewed"
    },
    {
      "id": "isabah-entry-00011415-segment-0002",
      "volume": 8,
      "scan_page": 217,
      "printed_page": 216,
      "reader_page": 4129,
      "reader_url": "https://usul.ai/t/isaba-fi-tamyiz/4129",
      "source_unit_id": "ibn_hajar_isabah_v1:arabic:v08:p0217:2806209a8535e29a",
      "arabic": "قال البخاريّ: رواه عبد الواحد بن واصل، عن غياث، عن جدته، قالت: ربما ألقينا في نبيذ رسول اللَّه ﷺ كفا من زبيب، وقال: الأول أصح.",
      "english": "al-Bukhari said: Abd al-Wahid ibn Wasil transmitted it from Ghiyath, from his grandmother, who said: “We would sometimes put a handful of raisins into the nabidh of the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace.” He said: “The former version is sounder.”",
      "arabic_sha256": "0e571e0ad138df107b8f6ed8c0d99b14de4fc34b0a2098337b27abc544b90edd",
      "english_sha256": "1953254fa849e372bc29de50094a69bbcef8c8c9a11773dbb93a13d55c000c57",
      "machine_state": "machine_validated_unreviewed"
